{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:45 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:45 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:45 2026-11-15 HKT</p><p>擔任經理人的林寶玉透露姚正菁正在內地平台發展，與她一起在中港兩地頻撲，經常不在香港，預計將安排她參演電影，至於姚正菁早前談到前夫的關係，她指對方的心情沒受影響。</p><h2>林寶玉認組女團有難度</h2><p>林寶玉透露正為女團擔任評審，近來正籌備組建女團，希望幫她們成功出道，成員年紀從13歲到20多歲都有，她坦言做女團有難度，特別是成員年紀小，很多事情要小心處理，對她而言也是好好學習的機會。</p><img alt=\"姚正菁到灣仔出席頒獎禮活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/91983f8f1f44cdc709b27a60291b7b06/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_17_23_53.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"擔任經理人的林寶玉透露姚正菁正在內地平台發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/60a3ccf92314688b30e18055a2a230a0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_17_23_55_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"與她一起在中港兩地頻撲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/aec2d3a0f1dc75de4d29cd4751d5f404/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_17_23_55.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"林寶玉透露正為女團擔任評審。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7532e04a12f48a7ffad27500ef5ec658/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_17_23_56.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"預計將安排姚正菁參演電影。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/08968ebd16480a851947148ff5119b17/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_17_24_07.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"至於姚正菁早前談到前夫的關係，她指對方的心情沒受影響。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/3eb78fe0cc40354620e67bef31018cc3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_17_24_09_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T15:02:48.974092+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T14:45:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T22:21:57.440492+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T14:56:21.808520+00:00","content_hash":"e29ef1e0f7c88ec75b2beb57d90e302292e5b2d07cf51ce32c78df1786674bca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}